                "description": "The Argos Lever with Rectangular Rose has a unique shape that makes it a favorite amongst designers who love the contemporary. It is sleek and sophisticated, and adsd a point of intrest to any door it is installed on. The Argos Lever with Modern Rectangular Rosette is available in a wide array of modern finishes. Choose from oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, and even satin brass. This contemporary leverset is available  in dummy, passage, and privacy functions and will even fit thick doors.\r\n",
